---
import YogaLayout from '../../../layouts/YogaLayout.astro';
---
<YogaLayout title="About | Setsuko Hata Yoga"
  description="Setsuko Hata is one of four Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga teachers in Japan, with over 1,750 hours of training in India. Her story and teaching philosophy."
  locale="en"
  active="about"
  ogTitle="Setsuko Hata Yoga Studio"
  ogDescription="Authentic Hatha Yoga instruction by a Sadhguru Certified teacher, trained over 1,750 hours in India. Classes in Tokyo and Osaka, and corporate wellness programs."
  themeColor="var(--color-surface-sage)"
  alternateHref="/hatha-yoga/ja/about/"
>

        <section class="ja-band ja-band-sage pt-32 md:pt-40">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-7xl px-6 md:px-10 pb-24 md:pb-32">
            <div
              class="grid items-center gap-14 md:grid-cols-[1.1fr_1fr] md:gap-20"
            >
              <div>
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  About
                </p>
                <h1
                  class="mt-6 font-display text-5xl leading-[1.05] text-brand-espresso md:text-7xl"
                >
                  Setsuko Hata
                </h1>
                <p
                  class="mt-4 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga Teacher
                </p>
                <div class="flex mt-8" aria-hidden="true">
                  <span
                    class="h-px w-16 origin-left bg-brand-tan motion-safe:animate-[brand-rule-draw_1.1s_ease-out]"
                  ></span>
                </div>
                <p class="mt-8 max-w-lg text-lg leading-relaxed text-brand-espresso">
                  Authentic Hatha Yoga instruction by one of only four Sadhguru
                  Certified Hatha Yoga Teachers in Japan, with over 1,750 hours
                  of intensive residential training in India, offering both
                  traditional Hatha Yoga for individuals and corporate wellness
                  programs for organizations.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div class="relative aspect-[4/5] overflow-hidden">
                <picture
                  ><source
                    type="image/webp"
                    srcset="/hatha-yoga/assets/setsuko-about.webp" />
                  <img
                    src="/hatha-yoga/assets/setsuko-about.jpg"
                    alt="Setsuko Hata"
                    width="816"
                    height="698"
                    class="h-full w-full object-cover"
                    fetchpriority="high"
                /></picture>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-paper py-24 md:py-32">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <div class="grid gap-14 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-20">
              <div>
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  Mission
                </p>
                <p class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl leading-snug md:text-3xl">
                  The purpose of yoga is to open up life&#x27;s fullest
                  possibility. Bringing body and mind into a state you can
                  direct at will: that is where instruction begins.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  Philosophy
                </p>
                <p class="mt-6 font-display text-2xl leading-snug md:text-3xl">
                  Yoga is often mistaken for a stretching exercise. Its real
                  meaning is union: the exchange between one&#x27;s own life and
                  the vastness beyond it.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="ja-band ja-band-sand py-28 md:py-40">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <figure class="mx-auto max-w-3xl text-center">
              <blockquote
                class="font-display text-3xl leading-[1.2] md:text-5xl md:leading-[1.15]"
              >
                Over 1,750 hours of residential training in India, learning
                Hatha Yoga&#x27;s precise system through the body, not only the
                intellect.
              </blockquote>
              <figcaption
                class="mt-8 font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.28em] opacity-70"
              >
                —
                <!-- -->Certified directly by Sadhguru, one of only four Hatha
                Yoga teachers in Japan to hold this certification.
              </figcaption>
            </figure>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-paper py-24 md:py-32">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
            >
              Journey
            </p>
            <div
              class="mt-10 divide-y divide-brand-espresso/10 border-t border-brand-espresso/10"
            >
              <div
                class="grid gap-4 py-10 md:grid-cols-[80px_240px_1fr] md:gap-10"
              >
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  01
                </p>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">The beginning</h3>
                <p class="max-w-xl text-brand-espresso/80">
                  An introduction to Hatha Yoga as a precise, living science.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="grid gap-4 py-10 md:grid-cols-[80px_240px_1fr] md:gap-10"
              >
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  02
                </p>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">Training in India</h3>
                <p class="max-w-xl text-brand-espresso/80">
                  Over 1,750 hours of residential training.
                </p>
              </div>
              <div
                class="grid gap-4 py-10 md:grid-cols-[80px_240px_1fr] md:gap-10"
              >
                <p
                  class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
                >
                  03
                </p>
                <h3 class="text-2xl">Teaching in Japan</h3>
                <p class="max-w-xl text-brand-espresso/80">
                  Teaching individuals and organizations across Tokyo and Osaka.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-brand-cream/60 py-24">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <p
              class="font-mono text-[13px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-brand-moss"
            >
              Credentials
            </p>
            <ul class="mt-10 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
              <li
                class="border-t border-brand-espresso/20 pt-5 text-brand-espresso/85"
              >
                Sadhguru Certified Hatha Yoga Teacher (one of four in Japan)
              </li>
              <li
                class="border-t border-brand-espresso/20 pt-5 text-brand-espresso/85"
              >
                1,750+ hours of residential training
              </li>
              <li
                class="border-t border-brand-espresso/20 pt-5 text-brand-espresso/85"
              >
                Individual instruction and corporate programs
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </section>
        <section class="bg-paper py-24 text-center md:py-32">
          <div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 md:px-10">
            <h2
              class="mx-auto max-w-2xl font-display text-4xl leading-[1.15] md:text-5xl"
            >
              See you in class
            </h2>
            <div class="mt-10">
              <a
                href="/hatha-yoga/en/contact/"
                class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 px-7 py-3.5 text-[14px] uppercase tracking-[0.18em] font-medium transition-colors duration-300 active:translate-y-px bg-brand-espresso text-white hover:bg-brand-moss"
                >Book a Class</a
              >
            </div>
          </div>
        </section>
</YogaLayout>
